# Optional overrides for the web client (Vite reads .env files automatically).
#
# Defaults (no file needed):
#  - Page loaded over HTTPS -> same-origin relative URLs. The vite dev server
#    terminates TLS and proxies /api, /ws, /archive to the plain backend, so
#    phones never hit "insecure WebSocket from HTTPS page" errors and the
#    backend needs no certificate.
#  - Page loaded over plain HTTP -> direct http://HOST:8000 + ws://HOST:8000.
#
# Point at a remote backend with real TLS instead (both must match: https+wss):
# VITE_API_BASE=https://192.168.1.50:8000
# VITE_WS_BASE=wss://192.168.1.50:8000
#
# Where the vite dev proxy forwards /api, /ws, /archive (default: local backend):
# BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:8000
